  "body": "Detonate or Renovate - PRIME CASTOR BAY \r\n43A Eastcliffe Road, Castor Bay\r\n\r\nFreehold Land: 722m² | Asking Price: $2,495,000\r\n\r\n*\tBlue-Chip Coastal Location: Secure 722m² of freehold land in one of the North Shore's most sought-after coastal suburbs.\r\n*\tRenovate or Rebuild: Refresh the existing brick cedar home, modernise to your taste or explore the potential to build your dream home (subject to council approval).\r\n*\tBeautiful Rangitoto Views: Elevated, north-facing position capturing excellent natural sunlight and stunning island views.\r\n*\tExisting Home: Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas across two levels.\r\n*\tFlexible Layout: Two bedrooms upstairs and two downstairs, with a separate lower-level lounge opening onto a private terrace.\r\n*\tExcellent Parking: Double internal-access garage, additional carport suitable for a boat or RV, plus ample off-street parking.\r\n*\tTop School Zones: Within Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High School zones, with Campbells Bay Primary and Wairau Intermediate nearby.\r\n*\tCoastal Lifestyle: Minutes from Castor Bay Beach, Milford Beach, local shops andCastor Bay Tennis Club.\r\n*\tMore Opportunity: 43B Eastcliffe Road is also for sale. An exciting opportunity to secure both properties and potentially combine a substantial coastal landholding of approximately 1,337m².\r\n\r\nLocation is everything! Whether you choose to renovate, rebuild or invest, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial freehold site in a premium coastal location with Rangitoto views.",
